<h2>5. Role-Based Dynamic Authentication (No Role Switchers)</h2>
<p>
  Unlike consumer apps with confusing UI role switchers, the CBH mobile login screen provides a single, high-trust corporate form. The server securely determines access:
</p>
<ol>
  <li>The user enters their corporate email (e.g. <code>admin@cbh.store</code> or <code>procurement@apexinfra.com</code>) and password.</li>
  <li>The app sends an HTTP POST request to <code>/api/auth/login</code>.</li>
  <li>Next.js queries MySQL: <code>SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?</code> and validates the bcrypt hash.</li>
  <li>The server returns the account payload including <code>role: 'admin'</code> or <code>role: 'customer'</code>.</li>
  <li>The mobile app dynamically activates the corresponding console:
    <ul>
      <li>If <code>role === 'admin'</code>: Launches the <strong>Admin Operations Console</strong>.</li>
      <li>If <code>role === 'customer'</code>: Launches the <strong>Customer B2B Storefront</strong>.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ol>

