<h2>7. How to Run & Verify</h2>
<pre>
# Terminal 1: Next.js API Server (Port 3000)
cd d:\CBH
npm run dev

# Terminal 2: Metro Bundler (Port 8081)
cd d:\CBH\mobile
npx react-native start --port 8081

# Terminal 3: Port Forwarding (USB Bridge)
adb reverse tcp:8081 tcp:8081
adb reverse tcp:3000 tcp:3000
</pre>

